{"toolCallId":"call_8e3ce3f1a8d7419cb02bbc98cf771e09","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/009-authoring-benchmark-and-closeout/spec.md:0\nspecs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/009-authoring-benchmark-and-closeout/plan.md:0\nspecs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/009-authoring-benchmark-and-closeout/tasks.md:0\n---\n---\ntitle: \"Feature Specification: Phase 9: authoring-benchmark-and-closeout\"\ndescription: \"Rerun the frozen authoring task three times on the final tree, report the before and after for five metrics, publish the benchmark report and changelogs, regenerate the trigger index and close the 054 packet.\"\ntrigger_phrases:\n  - \"authoring benchmark and closeout\"\n  - \"phase 9 authoring benchmark and closeout\"\n  - \"weak model authoring delta\"\n  - \"054 packet closeout\"\nimportance_tier: \"normal\"\ncontextType: \"general\"\n---\n<!-- SPECKIT_TEMPLATE_SOURCE: spec-core + level2-verify + level3-arch | v2.2 -->\n# Feature Specification: Phase 9: authoring-benchmark-and-closeout\n\n<!-- SPECKIT_LEVEL: 3 -->\n\n\n---\n\n## EXECUTIVE SUMMARY\n\nPhase 1 first measured a DeepSeek V4.1 Flash worker on a Level 2 packet, and the parent later replaced that with a Level 3 baseline on cli-devin swe-2-max, taken before any template changed. This phase measures the same Level 3 task the same way on the final tree and reports the difference for five metrics, each as a minimum and a maximum over three runs. It then publishes the benchmark report, writes the changelogs, regenerates the trigger index, refreshes the track roots and closes the packet against the seven criteria in `../goal.md` section 3.\n\n**Key Decisions**: the frozen task text is copied byte for byte from phase 1, and leftover hints are counted as bare v2.2 hints plus v2.3 value tokens so the two sides share one definition.\n\n**Critical Dependencies**: phases 1 to 8 are closed, the write-recipe child is closed and the launch preconditions in `../spec.md` section 3 are met and recorded in `../goal.md` section 4.\n\n---\n<!-- ANCHOR:metadata -->\n## 1. METADATA\n\n| Field | Value |\n|-------|-------|\n| **Level** | 3 |\n| **Priority** | P0 |\n| **Status** | In Progress (acceptance rows AC-010, AC-011 and AC-015 unmet because parent criterion 5 failed) |\n| **Created** | 2026-10-23 |\n| **Branch** | `main` |\n| **Parent Spec** | ../spec.md |\n| **Phase** | 9 of 9 |\n"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/cwd":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/217-weak-model-spec-authoring","terminal_exit":{"terminal_id":"bf229e","exit_code":0,"signal":null},"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
